            "review_title": "Review at ELSOL Meat & Wine",
            "review_text": "Noah\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam65 contributions\n0\nDinning at Elsol\nJul 2023 • Friends\nI'm so glad that we found this hidden little fantastic steak house. Everything is filled with romantic details. \nThe salad bar is fascinating. But in my opinons, the best here must be the Ribeye steak, it's super tender, very rich and juicy. The mocktails are truly bring up the tatse. \nGood prices, friendly service.\n\nHighly recommend for dating.\nI'll come again later.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 27, 2023",
